# Negative Tests for typed break/continue statements
# These will parse, but not execute.
# Exits prevent tests from hanging should they
# accidentally succeed

// -- BASIC --

# Can only use Break/Continue, Exit/Continue Do, and Exit/Continue While
Do While True: Exit For;           Exit; Loop
Do While True: Continue For;       Exit; Loop
Do While True: Exit Perform;       Exit; Loop
Do While True: Exit Perform Cycle; Exit; Loop

# Can only use Break/Continue and Exit/Continue Do
Do Until False: Exit For;           Exit; Loop
Do Until False: Continue For;       Exit; Loop
Do Until False: Exit While;         Exit; Loop
Do Until False: Continue While;     Exit; Loop
Do Until False: Exit Perform;       Exit; Loop
Do Until False: Exit Perform Cycle; Exit; Loop

# Can only use Break/Continue and Exit/Continue For
For x = 1 To 3: Exit Do;               Exit; Next
For x = 1 To 3: Continue Do;           Exit; Next
For x = 1 To 3: Exit While;            Exit; Next
For x = 1 To 3: Continue While;        Exit; Next
For Each x in [1]: Exit Do;            Exit; Next
For Each x in [1]: Continue Do;        Exit; Next
For Each x in [1]: Exit While;         Exit; Next
For Each x in [1]: Continue While;     Exit; Next
For Each x in [1]: Exit Perform;       Exit; Next
For Each x in [1]: Exit Perform Cycle; Exit; Next

// -- COBOL --

# Can only use Break/Continue
Perform 3 Times: Exit Do;        Exit; End-Perform
Perform 3 Times: Continue Do;    Exit; End-Perform
Perform 3 Times: Exit While;     Exit; End-Perform
Perform 3 Times: Continue While; Exit; End-Perform
Perform 3 Times: Exit For;       Exit; End-Perform
Perform 3 Times: Continue For;   Exit; End-Perform

Perform Until False: Exit Do;        Exit; End-Perform
Perform Until False: Continue Do;    Exit; End-Perform
Perform Until False: Exit While;     Exit; End-Perform
Perform Until False: Continue While; Exit; End-Perform
Perform Until False: Exit For;       Exit; End-Perform
Perform Until False: Continue For;   Exit; End-Perform

Perform Varying x From 1 By 1 Until x > 3: Exit Do;        Exit; End-Perform
Perform Varying x From 1 By 1 Until x > 3: Continue Do;    Exit; End-Perform
Perform Varying x From 1 By 1 Until x > 3: Exit While;     Exit; End-Perform
Perform Varying x From 1 By 1 Until x > 3: Continue While; Exit; End-Perform
Perform Varying x From 1 By 1 Until x > 3: Exit For;       Exit; End-Perform
Perform Varying x From 1 By 1 Until x > 3: Continue For;   Exit; End-Perform

# Not valid in Evaluate outside of a loop
Evaluate True: When True: Break; End-Evaluate
Evaluate True: When True: Continue; End-Evaluate

// -- VGR --

# Can't just be free-floating
Break;
Exit Do;
Exit For;
Exit While;
Exit Perform;
Continue;
Continue Do;
Continue For;
Continue While;
Exit Perform Cycle;

# Not valid in an If or Unless outside of a loop
# (no need to test all variants...)
If True: Break;                Exit; End-If
If True: Continue;             Exit; End-If
If False: Nop; Else: Break;    Exit; End-If
If False: Nop; Else: Continue; Exit; End-If
Unless False: Break;           Exit; End-Unless
Unless False: Continue;        Exit; End-Unless

# Not valid in a Choose and Choose Using outside of a loop
Choose: When True: Break;               End-Choose
Choose: When True: Continue;            End-Choose
Choose Using True: When True: Break;    End-Choose
Choose Using True: When True: Continue; End-Choose

# Break/Continue valid in VGR loops, and any type that
# matches the "verb"
Do Forever: Exit For;           Exit; End-Do
Do Forever: Continue For;       Exit; End-Do
Do Forever: Exit While;         Exit; End-Do
Do Forever: Continue While;     Exit; End-Do
Do Forever: Exit Perform;       Exit; End-Do
Do Forever: Exit Perform Cycle; Exit; End-Do

Repeat 3 Times: Exit Do;            Exit; End-Repeat
Repeat 3 Times: Continue Do;        Exit; End-Repeat
Repeat 3 Times: Exit For;           Exit; End-Repeat
Repeat 3 Times: Continue For;       Exit; End-Repeat
Repeat 3 Times: Exit While;         Exit; End-Repeat
Repeat 3 Times: Continue While;     Exit; End-Repeat
Repeat 3 Times: Exit Perform;       Exit; End-Repeat
Repeat 3 Times: Exit Perform Cycle; Exit; End-Repeat

Until False: Exit Do;            Exit; End-Until
Until False: Continue Do;        Exit; End-Until
Until False: Exit For;           Exit; End-Until
Until False: Continue For;       Exit; End-Until
Until False: Exit While;         Exit; End-Until
Until False: Continue While;     Exit; End-Until
Until False: Exit Perform;       Exit; End-Until
Until False: Exit Perform Cycle; Exit; End-Until

While True: Exit Do;            Exit; End-While
While True: Continue Do;        Exit; End-While
While True: Exit For;           Exit; End-While
While True: Continue For;       Exit; End-While
While True: Exit Perform;       Exit; End-While
While True: Exit Perform Cycle; Exit; End-While

For Each x in [1]: Exit Do;            Exit; End-For
For Each x in [1]: Continue Do;        Exit; End-For
For Each x in [1]: Exit While;         Exit; End-For
For Each x in [1]: Continue While;     Exit; End-For
For Each x in [1]: Exit Perform;       Exit; End-For
For Each x in [1]: Exit Perform Cycle; Exit; End-For
